          <li><i data-lucide="minus"></i><span>May push a full intake replacement</span></li>
          <li><i data-lucide="x"></i><span>Days-long backlog and waitlists</span></li>
          <li><i data-lucide="x"></i><span>A call center between you and the tech</span></li>
          <li><i data-lucide="x"></i><span>Upsells at the service desk</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- REVIEWS -->
<section class="sec alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">San Antonio drivers trust us</span>
      <h2 class="h2">4.9 stars, power restored.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rev-grid">
      <div class="rcard feat reveal">
        <div class="rs" data-stars></div>
        <p>"My 335i had a rough idle and misfire codes for months. GCS walnut-blasted the valves and it runs like new again — smooth idle, power's back. Way less than the dealer wanted."</p>
